Export pack for {client}
Made on {date} by {maker} in Selah.

What is inside:
- projects.csv: {projects, plural, one {# project} other {# projects}}
- recommendations.csv: the recommendations shared with your organisation
- actions.csv: {actions, plural, one {# action} other {# actions}}, with how each one still open at closing was settled and who sustains it
- files.csv: every file, with its SHA-256 checksum and its place in this pack
- files/: {files, plural, one {# file} other {# files}}
- manifest.json: the SHA-256 checksum of every entry, to show nothing changed

Only records shared with your organisation or private to it are included.{skipped, plural, =0 {} one { One file was over the size limit and is listed in files.csv only.} other { # files were over the size limit and are listed in files.csv only.}}
